From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Neale <14976+michaelneale@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:27:44 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] skippy: add clef joint decision reads

Render the systemone template, tokenize the prompt pieces with their
decision order, and read one score per option from the embeddings output
in one micro-batch, as the upstream server does for clef.
